{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4d8cea42-d21e-8249-976f-41d2405fce4b",
  "created_at": "2026-01-02T10:18:55-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ellen Chase",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:16:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:16:26-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. This is Ellen Chase. I have a couch I need to get rid of, and I wondered how I go about putting it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:16:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing, happy to help. So a couch, that's what we call a bulk item. Is it just the one couch, or is there other stuff with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:16:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the couch. It's a three-cushion. Fabric."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:16:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, one three-cushion couch. And where would it be picked up from? What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:16:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "150 Broadway. That's in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:16:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "150 Broadway, got it. Writing that down. Is it going out front at the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:17:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the curb. There's no other way to get it out, really. It's by the front walk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:17:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Curb is where it goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:17:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is there a fee for it? I wasn't sure if they charge for the big things."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:17:20-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Generally bulk pickup is something you schedule ahead, and sometimes there's a sticker or a charge depending on the item. I don't have the exact amount in front of me, so let me put you on a quick hold and check with the supervisor. Is that all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:17:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I'll wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:17:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Just a minute."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:17:41-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:17:42-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. So the couch counts as bulk, and yes, there is a fee for that. The office will tell you the amount when you schedule. I can set up the pickup request now for your address, and someone will call you with the fee and the date. Does this number work, the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:18:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It does. 401-555-0157."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:18:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "555-0157. Perfect. And Chase, C-H-A-S-E?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:18:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:18:09-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So I have Ellen Chase, 150 Broadway, one fabric couch for curbside bulk pickup, and a callback with the fee and the pickup day. Until they call, keep it inside if you can. Don't put it out early, since it can get wet or get in the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:18:26-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I can keep it in the porch. My neighbor showed me how to fix a leaky faucet last year, so I'm used to waiting on things around here. I'll just wait for the call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:18:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good to have a neighbor like that. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:18:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:18:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Chase. Have a good Friday and a happy new year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:18:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
